        <dc:title>Curse of the Cubi: An Incubus Tale</dc:title>
        <dc:creator opf:file-as="Warbaum, Joshiah" opf:role="aut">Warbaum, Joshiah</dc:creator>
        <dc:contributor opf:file-as="calibre" opf:role="bkp">calibre (3.42.0) [https://calibre-ebook.com]</dc:contributor>
        <dc:date>2017-03-09T00:00:00+00:00</dc:date>
        <dc:description>&lt;p&gt;A drunk mind speaks a sober heart, or so the saying goes...   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darien is a suave incubus that has been operating for centuries, never quite satisfying his appetite for carnal pleasures.   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;His journey leads him into an old bar, where he captivates a handsome young mouse named Scott with tales from when he allowed his sexual fervor to run wild, knowing he may not have much time left to enjoy those memories...   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scott listens on with an eager blush as Darien regales him with the story of why he must choose between lust and love...&lt;/p&gt;</dc:description>
